# Unsummon says "target creature": Bot1's Mox Sapphire is not a creature and Bot2's Sylvan Caryatid has hexproof
# (CR 702.11b), so neither is a legal target (the refusals), while Bot2's Llanowar Elves, a legal target of the very same
# spell, is the control. The Unsummon then returns only the Elves; the Caryatid stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Unsummon
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Sylvan Caryatid
Forest x11

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sylvan Caryatid.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
! Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid)
Bot1.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby; Sylvan Caryatid
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsummon
